itted index, solicit voter heartbeat confirmations, release a queue prefix and deliver ReadyToRead locally or remotely; local application must reach the result index before successful client completion.',['B-replicate','B-read-admit','B-read-release','B-read-receive','B-storage','B-apply','B-client-read'],['F-commit','F-read-pending'],['M-core-formation','M-log-protection','M-read-queue','M-read-release','M-engine-order','M-consumers','M-read-batches']),context=path('Election ticks on eligible full nodes trigger campaigns unless committed work remains unapplied. Candidate increments term and votes for self; vote grant compares log freshness and prior vote; responses are member-filtered, observer-excluded and sender-deduplicated. Quorum promotes leader and appends noop. Higher-term messages normally step down; old nonzero terms are rejected, with recent-leader vote suppression. CheckQuorum can remove authority; transfer waits for target replication then sends TimeoutNow and suppresses proposals meanwhile. Membership application changes voter sets, removes local leader authority and permits observer promotion; startup and snapshot recovery reconstruct context without recovering old read confirmations.',['B-authority','B-config','B-storage','B-recovery'],['F-commit'],['M-core-context','M-core-formation','M-vote-handler','M-dispatch','M-ticks','M-transfer','M-membership','M-startup']),connection=path('Term/role reset discards votes, remote replication progress and pending leader read confirmations while retaining committed log history. Subsequent leaders reconstruct pending configuration status and establish current-term support before normal multi-voter reads. Applied membership defines eligible votes/replica support and contextual heartbeat recipients; old responses must pass term and member checks before counting. Committed-but-unapplied history blocks a new campaign to avoid using stale membership. Application feeds accepted configuration and last-applied progress b